  "idea": "Automated bug triage system that routes user reports directly to Linear",
  "text": "How to turn user bug reports from Intercom into structured Linear engineering tickets. Support reps spend hours asking customers for device specs, browser logs, and missing reproduction steps. Engineers waste half their sprint deciphering vague bug descriptions instead of shipping product updates. Automate the pipeline by routing Intercom conversations through Make to extract stack traces and create tagged Linear issues. Your engineering team resolves critical production errors twice as fast.",
